	measure '11. Counter % PY suppl MTD/YTD' = ```
			
			    VAR __StartDate = STARTOFYEAR(dim_DateTable[Date])
			    VAR __EndDate = ENDOFYEAR(dim_DateTable[Date])
			    VAR __DateRange = DATESBETWEEN(dim_DateTable[Date], __StartDate, __EndDate)
			    VAR __Result = 
			        IF(
			            SELECTEDVALUE('TBL Time Period'[Name]) = "YTD",
			            CALCULATE(
			                [04. Counter % PY YTD],
			                __DateRange,
			                USERELATIONSHIP(Date_Supplemental[Date], dim_DateTable[Date])
			            ),
			            CALCULATE(
			                [03. Counter % PY],
			                __DateRange,
			                USERELATIONSHIP(Date_Supplemental[Date], dim_DateTable[Date])
			            )
			        )
			    RETURN __Result
			```
		formatString: 0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%
		lineageTag: 703d5479-e8da-4b03-a8aa-08428c60f840

